<title>GREECE: GREEK INTRACOM'S KOKKALIS TO ATTEND EU TELECOM MEETING.</title>
<headline>GREEK INTRACOM'S KOKKALIS TO ATTEND EU TELECOM MEETING.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The president of Greek Intracom , Sokratis Kokkalis, will attend an informal meeting of EU industry ministers meeting in Hague on Saturday, Intracom's affiliate Intrasoft said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>The main issue that will be discussed at the meeting will be the internal market's operation and competitiveness in the software and telecommunications.</p>
<p>A special study comparing the European and international markets has been conducted and its results will be discussed on Saturday, it said.</p>
<p>--Margarita Sotiropoulou, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
